/ActualText (Product Designer with 4 years of end-to-end experience shipping digital products across AI and EV mobility domains. Proven track record as a solo designer owning the full design lifecycle, from user research and information architecture to interaction design, component libraries, and developer handoff. Adept at translating complex system behaviors and ambiguous problem spaces into intuitive, accessible user experiences. Experienced collaborating directly with founders and engineering teams in fast-paced, 0-1 startup environments to align design strategy with product and business goals.)
